From: Kartheek E <karte@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] pwhm: Fix Disable11be/Disable11ax MLD restore after reboot

Signed-off-by: Kartheek E <karte@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
